","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-18T08:26:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T09:40:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123599","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123599","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123599.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123599.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Part of #43440.\n\nThe existing tests for `PlaceHolderScriptInstance` only covered `set()`/`get()` and `update()` of properties. This PR adds coverage for the rest of its public behavior:\n\n- `get_property_list()` reflects the properties passed via `update()`\n- `get_property_type()` for a known value, a constant, and an unknown name\n- `get_method_list()` / `has_method()` when the script is valid vs. when it's an invalid/fallback script\n- `callp()` always returns `CALL_ERROR_INVALID_METHOD`\n- Setting an unregistered property on an invalid script registers a new property through the fallback path\n\n`_MockScript` is extended with `method_infos`/`method_names` so method list and `has_method()` behavior can be exercised.\n\nAll 11 test cases in `[PlaceholderScriptInstance]` pass locally (`bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --test --test-suite=\"[PlaceholderScriptInstance]\"`).","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123599/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123599/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}